# Git Hygiene

Never commit:

- **`.env`** – environment secrets, API keys, tokens
- **`data/*.db`**, **`data/*.sqlite*`** – database files
- **`data/live_orders.log`** – runtime logs
- **`scripts/data/.questrade_token`** – Questrade refresh token
- **`.streamlit/secrets.toml`** – Streamlit secrets

These are in `.gitignore`; avoid `git add -f` or overrides that would add them.
